    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Alliance Auctioneers are delighted to bring Main Street, Mullagh, to the market. A attractive orginal featured 3 bed terraced townhouse. Nestled in the heart of Mullagh town extending to approx 55 sq.m. This home is presented in good condition through-out and gives the oppertunity for the new owner to put their own touches to the home. \r\n\r\nThe accomodation comprises of Entrance hall, living room, Kitchen, updatirs landing, 3 good sized bedrooms and a main bathroom completing the house. Located within a short stroll to a host of amenties that Mullagh town has to offer. To the rear of the property there is a private enclosed space.\r\n\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nMullagh is a thriving and attractive town with a wide range of amenities including shops, a primary school, playground, Mullagh Community Sports Centre, Killian's Lodge Hotel, and St. Kilian's Heritage Centre, among others. The property is conveniently located just 10km from Virginia, 12km from Kells, 30km from Navan, and approximately 76km from Dublin Airport, providing excellent connectivity to surrounding towns and major transport routes.\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall 0.85m  3.40m. Tiled Flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room 2.91m x 3.00m. Wooden Flooring, Feature Fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen 3.86m x 2.89m. Tiled Flooring, Fitted Carpentry\r\n\r\nLanding 1.64m x 2.29m. Carpet Flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 3.86m x 2.23m. Wood Flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 2.41m x 2.95m. Carpet Flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 2.12m x 2.89m. Wood Flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom 1.64m x 1.89m. Tiled Flooring, WHB, Bath, W/C"
      },
